flowchart LR
    accTitle: Reset credentials with the Recovery Key
    accDescr: The current Recovery Key unwraps the existing DEK. The app authenticates the vault and confirms a new Master Password, saved replacement key and new Authenticator code before committing new wrappers. The vault ciphertext is preserved; success returns to sign-in rather than opening a session.
    subgraph desktop["Desktop App / Core"]
        direction LR
        verify{"`Key + vault valid?`"}:::decision
        setup["`Confirm new credentials`"]
        rewrap["`Rewrap same DEK`"]
        commit{"Success?"}:::decision
        stop["`Stop / keep old state`"]:::danger
        login["`Return to sign-in`"]:::good
    end
    verify -->|No| stop
    verify -->|Yes| setup
    setup -->|Confirmed| rewrap
    setup -->|Cancel / invalid| stop
    rewrap --> commit
    commit -->|Failure| stop
    commit -->|Success| login
    classDef key fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0f172a,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef decision fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#d97706,color:#0f172a
    classDef danger fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#991b1b
    classDef good fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    style desktop stroke-dasharray:5 4
